Description: Provides two related datasets on legislative parties
    and political coalitions in 21 countries of the Americas
    (20 Latin American countries and the United States) since 1925.
    The current version covers the period from 1925 to 2024.
    The first dataset, `parties`, contains annual information
    on political parties and party factions represented in
    national legislatures, including legislative seats and
    governing coalition membership. The second dataset, `parties2`,
    aggregates this information at the country-year level and
    includes additional party-system indicators, such as the
    effective number of parties and the legislative strength
    of presidents and governing coalitions in each chamber.
